<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Anime Game</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.3.1/css/bootstrap.min.css" integrity="sha384-ggOyR0iXCbMQv3Xipma34MD+dH/1fQ784/j6cY/iJTQUOhcWr7x9JvoRxT2MZw1T" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles-index.css">
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <h1>AnimeSannin</h1>
    </header>
  <div class="center spaced">
    <h1>How well do you know your anime?</h1>
    <div class="spaced">
      <p>Hello fellow anime enthusiasts! I created this game as a fun way to test the breadth of your knowledge! <br></p>
      <p>First, pick a few genres that you want to test your expertise in!</p>
    </div>
    <!-- every choice is a real form field, so pressing Play sends them all in one request -->
    <form action="/start" method="post">
      <div class="genresTable">
        <div class="row no-gutters">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="action"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">action</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="comedy"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">comedy</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="adventure"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">adventure</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="drama"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">drama</span></label></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row no-gutters">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="slice of life"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">slice of life</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="erotica"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">erotica</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="fantasy"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">fantasy</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="magic"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">magic</span></label></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row no-gutters">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="supernatural"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">supernatural</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="horror"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">horror</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="mystery"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">mystery</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="psychological"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">psychological</span></label></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row no-gutters">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="romance"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">romance</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="science fiction"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">science fiction</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="thriller"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">thriller</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="genres" value="tournament"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">tournament</span></label></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>Which do you know better?</p>
      <div class="mOrA">
        <div class="row no-gutters">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="types" value="anime"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">Anime</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="types" value="manga"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">Manga</span></label></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>What level are you at?</p>
      <div class="mOrA">
        <div class="row no-gutters">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-4"><label class="toggle"><input type="radio" name="difficulty" value="Normal" checked><span class="difficulty btn btn-success shadow-none">Normal</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-4"><label class="toggle"><input type="radio" name="difficulty" value="Expert"><span class="difficulty btn btn-success shadow-none">Expert</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-4"><label class="toggle"><input type="radio" name="difficulty" value="Master"><span class="difficulty btn btn-success shadow-none">Master</span></label></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>When were your weeb years?</p>
      <div class="genresTable">
        <div class="row no-gutters">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-4"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="decades" value="2010"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">2010s</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-4"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="decades" value="2000"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">2000s</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-4"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="decades" value="1990"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">1990s</span></label></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row no-gutters">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="decades" value="1980"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">1980s</span></label></div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="decades" value="1970"><span class="genres btn btn-success shadow-none">1970s</span></label></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>Finally, put in your username so you can showoff your score!</p>
      <div class="inputField">
        <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="Player Name" autocomplete="off" maxlength="20">
      </div>
      <div class="play">
        <h6>Whenever you're ready, click play below!</h6>
        <button class="btn btn-success btn-lg" type="submit">Play!</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
  </body>
</html>
